<title>ITALY: Ex-GE's Giuliano Venturi to be new Albacom MD.</title>
<headline>Ex-GE's Giuliano Venturi to be new Albacom MD.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Giuliano Venturi will be the new managing director of Albacom SpA, the joint telecoms venture between British Telecom, Italian bank BNL and TV group Mediaset, an Albacom statement said.</p>
<p>Venturi, who takes over from Paolo Donzella on April 14, has worked for 18 years with General Electric Co where his last post was director general of GE's Nuovo Pignone turbine maker unit in Florence.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
